AHHResolution -- Aramova-Herzog-Hibi minimal free resolution of a squarefree-stable ideal
*****************************************************************************************

  * Usage: 
        AHHResolution I
  * Inputs:
      * I, a *note monomial ideal: (Macaulay2Doc)MonomialIdeal,, that is
        squarefree stable
  * Outputs:
      * a *note chain complex: (OldChainComplexes)ChainComplex,, the
        Aramova-Herzog-Hibi resolution of S/I

Description
===========

Assembles the maps from *note AHH: AHH, into a chain complex.  For a
squarefree-stable monomial ideal the result is a minimal free resolution of S/I
by [AHH].

+-------------------------------------+
|i1 : R = QQ[x,y,z]                   |
|                                     |
|o1 = R                               |
|                                     |
|o1 : PolynomialRing                  |
+-------------------------------------+
|i2 : I = monomialIdeal(x*y, x*z, y*z)|
|                                     |
|o2 = monomialIdeal (x*y, x*z, y*z)   |
|                                     |
|o2 : MonomialIdeal of R              |
+-------------------------------------+
|i3 : AHHR = AHHResolution I          |
|                                     |
|      1      3      2                |
|o3 = R  <-- R  <-- R                 |
|                                     |
|     0      1      2                 |
|                                     |
|o3 : Complex                         |
+-------------------------------------+
|i4 : betti AHHR == betti res I       |
|                                     |
|o4 = true                            |
+-------------------------------------+
|i5 : isResolution(AHHR, I)           |
|                                     |
|o5 = true                            |
+-------------------------------------+

Caveat
======

The function does not check that I is squarefree stable.

See also
========

  * *note isSQStable: isSQStable, -- test whether a squarefree monomial ideal
    is squarefree stable
  * *note AHH: AHH, -- n-th map in the Aramova-Herzog-Hibi resolution
  * *note EKResolution: EKResolution, -- Eliahou-Kervaire minimal free
    resolution of a stable monomial ideal
  * *note isResolution: isResolution, -- test whether a chain complex resolves
    the quotient by a monomial ideal

Ways to use AHHResolution:
==========================

  * "AHHResolution(MonomialIdeal)"

For the programmer
==================

