appendZeroMap -- append a zero map to chain complex
***************************************************

  * Usage: 
        appendZeroMap C
  * Inputs:
      * C, a *note chain complex: (OldChainComplexes)ChainComplex,, 
  * Outputs:
      * a *note chain complex: (OldChainComplexes)ChainComplex,, 

Description
===========

Add a zero map after the last differential in a chain complex.

+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i1 : S=ZZ/101[x,y]/ideal(x*y)                                                |
|                                                                             |
|o1 = S                                                                       |
|                                                                             |
|o1 : QuotientRing                                                            |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i2 : C=chainComplex(matrix{{x}},matrix{{y}}**S^{ -1},matrix{{x}}**S^{ -2})[1]|
|                                                                             |
|      1      1      1      1                                                 |
|o2 = S  <-- S  <-- S  <-- S                                                  |
|                                                                             |
|     -1     0      1      2                                                  |
|                                                                             |
|o2 : ChainComplex                                                            |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i3 : appendZeroMap C                                                         |
|                                                                             |
|      1      1      1      1                                                 |
|o3 = S  <-- S  <-- S  <-- S  <-- 0                                           |
|                                                                             |
|     -1     0      1      2      3                                           |
|                                                                             |
|o3 : ChainComplex                                                            |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i4 : prependZeroMap C                                                        |
|                                                                             |
|             1      1      1      1                                          |
|o4 = 0  <-- S  <-- S  <-- S  <-- S                                           |
|                                                                             |
|     -2     -1     0      1      2                                           |
|                                                                             |
|o4 : ChainComplex                                                            |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+

Ways to use appendZeroMap:
==========================

  * "appendZeroMap(ChainComplex)"

