isElement -- test whether a ring element lies in a monomial ideal
*****************************************************************

  * Usage: 
        isElement(f, I)
  * Inputs:
      * f, a *note ring element: (Macaulay2Doc)RingElement,, 
      * I, a *note monomial ideal: (Macaulay2Doc)MonomialIdeal,, 
  * Outputs:
      * a *note Boolean value: (Macaulay2Doc)Boolean,, whether f lies in I

Description
===========

An element of a polynomial ring lies in a monomial ideal if and only if every
