|o2 = monomialIdeal (x*y, x z)             |
|                                          |
|o2 : MonomialIdeal of R                   |
+------------------------------------------+
|i3 : isElement(x^2*y + x*y*z + x^3*z^3, I)|
|                                          |
|o3 = true                                 |
+------------------------------------------+
|i4 : isElement(x*y^2 + x^3*y*z + z^2, I)  |
|                                          |
|o4 = false                                |
+------------------------------------------+

