|b*c^2*d^5*e^4);                                                              |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i3 : s = scarfComplex I                                                      |
|                                                                             |
|      1      5      8      3                                                 |
|o3 = R  <-- R  <-- R  <-- R  <-- 0                                           |
|                                                                             |
|     0      1      2      3      4                                           |
|                                                                             |
|o3 : ChainComplex                                                            |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i4 : s.dd                                                                    |
|                                                                             |
|          1                                                5                 |
|o4 = 0 : R  <-------------------------------------------- R  : 1             |
|               | b4c3 ab3cd2e ab2c2de2 bc2d5e4 a2d3e5 |                      |
|                                                                             |
|          5                                                               8  |
|     1 : R  <----------------------------------------------------------- R  :|
|               {7}  | -ad2e -ade2 0   -d5e4 0     0     0      0     |       |
|               {8}  | bc2   0     -ce 0     0     -ade4 0      0     |       |
|               {8}  | 0     b2c   bd  0     -d4e2 0     -ad2e3 0     |       |
