|               {10} | 0     0     0   0     0     b3c   b2c2   bc2d2 |       |
|                                                                             |
|          8                            3                                     |
|     2 : R  <------------------------ R  : 3                                 |
|               {11} | e  0    0   |                                          |
|               {11} | -d 0    0   |                                          |
|               {10} | bc ade3 0   |                                          |
